    String observed = "a abc ab Document abcde Text abcd ZZZZ WWWW Lots diagram iiii Hello !magic! ditaa Z 0123456789 The x i ABCDEFGHIJ abcdefghij W m jumps lazy .... MMMM llll Zg Ty AV ffi fi";
